notes.content:
Hello everyone, I hope you're having a great day!
We are releasing a super update to our game, where we made improvements to the game quality, fixed bugs and problems reported by you players:

- Shooter orc collision issue;
- Being able to start the game without orcs in the selection box;
- Spear thrower's spear collision problem;
- The disappearance of the back button in the gallery room; 
- Balancing of very strong enemy units.

Many thanks to everyone who played and for your feedback, as we are a small team it takes a while to fix all the problems, but we hope that the improvements will make the game more enjoyable for everyone.
